      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Persona: \"Alex\"\n\nAn individual tracking personal tasks alone —\nnot a team or project-management tool.\nGoal: quickly create, prioritize, and complete\npersonal to-dos, and trust that only they can\nsee or change their own tasks.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User Persona: \"Alex\"\n\nAn individual tracking personal tasks alone —\nnot a team or project-management tool.\nGoal: quickly create, prioritize, and complete\npersonal to-dos, and trust that only they can\nsee or change their own tasks.",
