      "text": "User Persona: \"Alex\"\nIndividual managing personal tasks alone.\nNeeds private data, simple sign-in, and\ntrust that only they see their own tasks.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User Persona: \"Alex\"\nIndividual managing personal tasks alone.\nNeeds private data, simple sign-in, and\ntrust that only they see their own tasks.",
