      "text": "Reusable Skill\njayisacoder-agent-handoff\nWhy a Skill, not a one-off prompt: the\nSAME verify -> handoff -> report procedure,\ninvoked by every subagent above, on every\ntask — not a single instruction used once.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Reusable Skill\njayisacoder-agent-handoff\nWhy a Skill, not a one-off prompt: the\nSAME verify -> handoff -> report procedure,\ninvoked by every subagent above, on every\ntask — not a single instruction used once.",
